[I] ASGI specification and utilities

[T] ASGI provides base libraries, including sync-to-async and
[T] async-to-sync function wrappers, server base classes, a threadlocal
[T] replacement, and a WSGI-to-ASGI adapter to ease transitions between
[T] synchronous and asynchronous code.

[U] https://github.com/django/asgiref/

